<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11389" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπανθ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>finish blooming,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.13.3
			</span></i>, al.; <i>fade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Genit.</u>
				9
			</span></i>: mostly metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				1121
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνανθεῖ . . καὶ ἀπηνθηκότι καὶ σώματι
					καὶ ψυχῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					196a
				</span></i>
			; so in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1410b15
			</span></i>, old age is compared to straw, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμφω
				γὰρ ἀπηνθηκότα,</span> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				18.2
			</span></i>, al.; of athletes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὑπὸ τῶν πόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Gym.</u>
					48
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of wine,
				<i>lose its sweetness,</i> i.e. <i>ripen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>break out,</i> of skin-eruptions, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				24.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
